from common import E
# Action-presentation batch 2 — 10 new cards. Theme-agnostic; timings and ranges are authoring starting points for feel, not balance.

E('ACT-45','戰鬥時間、命中反應與防護','Pogo bounce / Downward strike bounce',["Pogo bounce","Pogo jump","Downward strike bounce","Down-slash bounce","Nail bounce","下劈反彈","下突彈跳","空中下劈彈起","ポゴジャンプ","下突きバウンド"],'C',
("下劈反彈（Pogo）",
 "角色在空中向下攻擊，武器判定碰到敵人、尖刺或特定物件的一刻，角色立即被向上彈起，高度約一次短跳；被打中的敵人閃白，接觸點爆出一小團火花，並有極短的命中停頓。彈起後可在下落時再次下劈，在敵人頭上或一排尖刺上連續彈跳而不落地；尖刺被武器先碰到，所以角色不會受傷。下劈落空時角色照常落下。",
 "不是土狼時間（ACT-01）或跳躍緩衝（ACT-02），那些是起跳的容錯。不是單純踩頭彈跳（只要身體踩中即可，不用攻擊）。不是擊退（ACT-29，被打的一方被推開）；這裡被反推的是攻擊者自己。也不是浮空連擊（ACT-47，把敵人打上半空）。",
 "平台動作的空中戰鬥、用尖刺當跳台的關卡、讓向下攻擊同時是移動手段的設計。",
 "為空中向下攻擊加入下劈反彈。玩家在空中按「下＋攻擊」時，武器判定向下伸出；判定碰到敵人、尖刺或標記為可彈的物件那一幀，把角色的豎直速度直接設為固定的向上值（約一次短跳的高度，不受當前下落速度影響），命中停頓 2–4 幀，在接觸點播放火花，被打的敵人閃白。反彈後恢復空中跳躍與衝刺次數，玩家可在下落時再次下劈連續彈跳；落空則照常落下。驗收：連續在三組尖刺上彈跳不受傷，而且每次彈起高度一致。"),
("Pogo bounce / Downward strike bounce",
 "The character attacks downward in mid-air; the moment the weapon's hitbox touches an enemy, spikes or certain props, the character pops straight back up about a short-hop high. The struck enemy flashes white, a small spark burst appears at the contact point, and there is a very short hit pause. On the way down the player can strike again and keep bouncing across enemy heads or a row of spikes without landing; the weapon touches the spikes first, so the character takes no damage. A down-strike that hits nothing just lets the character fall as normal.",
 "Not coyote time (ACT-01) or jump buffering (ACT-02), which forgive the take-off. Not a plain head-stomp bounce (the body lands on the enemy, no attack needed). Not knockback (ACT-29, where the victim is pushed away); here the attacker is the one pushed back. Not an air juggle (ACT-47, which keeps the enemy in the air).",
 "Mid-air combat in platformers, levels that turn spike pits into stepping stones, designs where the down attack doubles as movement.",
 "Add a pogo bounce to the mid-air down attack. When the player presses down + attack in the air, extend the weapon hitbox below the feet; on the first frame it touches an enemy, spikes or a prop tagged as bounceable, set the character's vertical speed straight to a fixed upward value (about a short hop, regardless of current fall speed), hitstop 2–4 frames, spawn sparks at the contact point and flash the struck enemy. Refresh air jumps and dash on bounce so the player can strike again while falling and chain bounces; a miss just falls normally. Accept: bouncing across three spike groups in a row deals no damage and every bounce reaches the same height."),
("下突きバウンド（ポゴ）",
 "空中で下向きに攻撃し、武器の判定が敵・トゲ・特定の物に触れた瞬間、キャラが小ジャンプほどの高さで真上に弾む。当たった敵は白く光り、接点に小さな火花が散り、ごく短いヒットストップが入る。落ちながらもう一度下突きすれば、敵の頭上やトゲの列の上を着地せずに跳ね続けられる。トゲには武器が先に触れるので、キャラはダメージを受けない。空振りならそのまま落ちる。",
 "コヨーテタイム（ACT-01）やジャンプ先行入力（ACT-02）のような踏み切りの猶予ではない。体で踏むだけの踏みつけジャンプ（攻撃不要）でもない。ノックバック（ACT-29、殴られた側が押される）でもなく、ここで押し返されるのは攻撃した本人。敵を空中に留める空中コンボ（ACT-47）でもない。",
 "プラットフォームアクションの空中戦、トゲの穴を足場に変えるステージ、下攻撃を移動手段にもする設計。",
 "空中の下攻撃に下突きバウンドを追加する。空中で「下＋攻撃」を押すと武器の判定を足元に伸ばし、敵・トゲ・バウンド可能タグの物に触れた最初のフレームで、キャラの縦速度を一定の上向きの値（小ジャンプ程度、現在の落下速度に関係なく）に設定し、2〜4 フレームのヒットストップ、接点に火花、当たった敵を白く光らせる。バウンド時に空中ジャンプとダッシュの回数を回復し、落下中に再び下突きして連続で跳ねられるようにする。空振りは通常どおり落下。検証：トゲの列を 3 つ続けて跳ねてもダメージがなく、毎回同じ高さまで跳ねること。"),
'bounce height (≈ short hop, fixed) · hitstop 2–4 f · down-hitbox reach & width · bounceable tags (enemy / spikes / props) · air jump & dash refresh on bounce · horizontal speed kept vs damped · one bounce per swing (authoring defaults)',
"Give the airborne down attack a hitbox below the feet that is tested before the body's hurtbox. On the first overlap with a bounceable tag (enemy hurtbox, hazard, bounce prop), overwrite vertical velocity with a fixed upward value so bounce height is consistent, apply a short hitstop, spawn contact sparks and optionally refresh air jumps and dash. Allow one bounce per swing; hazards touched by the hitbox first do not damage the player.",
['ACT-03','ACT-21','ACT-29','ACT-47','ACT-01','ACT-05'],['a2_hk_nail','a2_w_shovel','a2_w_ducktales'])

E('FB-32','物件反應','Projectile reflect / Batting',["Projectile reflect","Deflect projectile","Bat back","Return fire with melee","Projectile parry","拍返飛行道具","彈返子彈","反彈光彈","弾き返し","反射打ち"],'C',
("拍返飛行道具（反彈）",
 "敵人的子彈、能量球或箭飛向玩家，玩家在攻擊判定生效的幾幀內揮擊碰到它：接觸點爆出火花並短暫停頓，道具立即掉頭飛回去，速度比來時更快，顏色由敵方的顏色（例如紅）變成玩家方的顏色（例如青），拖尾變長變亮。它現在只會傷害敵人，擊中原本的發射者時有特別大的命中效果。揮得太早或太遲，道具照常打中玩家。",
 "不是完美格擋（FB-26，對手的近身武器被彈開，沒有飛回去的道具）。不是護盾吸收（MATX-08，道具撞上護盾後消失）。不是念力抓物投擲（FB-33，先抓住、懸浮在手前，再由玩家擲出）。拍返是在一次揮擊之內直接把道具打回去。",
 "近戰武器彈開光束、與 Boss 互相拍打能量球、近戰與射擊混合的動作遊戲、教玩家用近戰回應遠程攻擊。",
 "為近戰加入拍返飛行道具。攻擊判定生效期間與可拍返的敵方道具重疊時：命中停頓 3–5 幀，接觸點播放火花與清脆擊打聲；道具改屬玩家陣營，顏色由敵方紅色換成玩家青色，方向改為指向原發射者（在瞄準輔助錐形內時），否則沿揮擊方向飛出，速度提升 1.3–1.8 倍，拖尾加長。擊中原發射者時播放加大的命中效果。不可拍返的道具用不同外形與顏色區分（見 NAV-16）。驗收：早揮、準時、遲揮三種結果分明，拍返後的道具不會再傷害玩家。"),
("Projectile reflect / Batting",
 "An enemy bullet, energy orb or arrow flies at the player; the player swings so the active hitbox meets it: sparks burst at the contact point with a brief pause, then the projectile turns around and flies back faster than it came, its colour switching from the enemy's (e.g. red) to the player's (e.g. cyan) with a longer, brighter trail. It now hurts only enemies, and hitting the original shooter plays an extra-large impact. Swinging too early or too late lets the projectile hit the player as usual.",
 "Not a perfect parry (FB-26, the opponent's melee weapon is knocked away; nothing flies back). Not shield absorption (MATX-08, the projectile vanishes on the shield). Not telekinetic grab and throw (FB-33, the object is caught, held floating in front of the player and then aimed). Batting sends the projectile back within a single swing.",
 "Melee weapons deflecting energy bolts, volleying an energy ball back and forth with a boss, melee-and-gun hybrids, teaching players to answer ranged attacks with melee.",
 "Add projectile batting to melee. While an attack hitbox is active and overlaps a reflectable enemy projectile: hitstop 3–5 frames, sparks and a crisp impact sound at the contact; switch the projectile to the player's team and recolour it from enemy red to player cyan; aim it at the original shooter if within an aim-assist cone, otherwise along the swing direction; multiply its speed by 1.3–1.8 and lengthen the trail. Hitting the original shooter plays an enlarged impact. Give non-reflectable projectiles a different shape and colour (see NAV-16). Accept: early, on-time and late swings give three clearly different results, and a batted projectile never hurts the player."),
("弾き返し（飛び道具の反射）",
 "敵の弾・エネルギー球・矢がプレイヤーへ飛んでくる。攻撃判定が有効な数フレームの間に振って当てると、接点で火花が散って一瞬止まり、飛び道具は来たときより速く向きを変えて飛び返す。色は敵側（例：赤）からプレイヤー側（例：シアン）に変わり、尾が長く明るくなる。以後は敵にだけ当たり、撃った本人に当たると特に大きなヒット演出が出る。振るのが早すぎても遅すぎても、飛び道具は普通にプレイヤーに当たる。",
 "ジャストガード（FB-26、相手の近接武器を弾くもので、飛んで戻る物はない）ではない。シールドでの吸収（MATX-08、当たった弾が消える）でもない。念動力で掴んで投げる（FB-33、いったん掴んで手前に浮かせ、狙って投げる）とも違う。弾き返しは一振りの中で直接打ち返す。",
 "近接武器でエネルギー弾を弾く、ボスとエネルギー球を打ち合う、近接と射撃を混ぜたアクション、遠距離攻撃に近接で応じることを教える場面。",
 "近接攻撃に弾き返しを追加する。攻撃判定が有効な間に反射可能な敵の飛び道具と重なったら、3〜5 フレームのヒットストップ、接点に火花と澄んだ打撃音。飛び道具をプレイヤー陣営に切り替え、敵の赤からプレイヤーのシアンへ色を変える。エイムアシストの円錐内なら撃った本人へ、そうでなければ振りの方向へ飛ばし、速度を 1.3〜1.8 倍にして尾を伸ばす。撃った本人に当たったら大きめのヒット演出。反射できない飛び道具は形と色で区別する（NAV-16 参照）。検証：早い・ちょうど・遅いの 3 つの振りで結果がはっきり違い、打ち返した弾がプレイヤーに当たらないこと。"),
'reflect window = attack active frames · hitstop 3–5 f · return speed ×1.3–1.8 · aim: back to shooter (assist cone) vs swing direction · team colour swap · trail length boost · reflectable vs non-reflectable look (authoring defaults)',
"Projectiles carry team, velocity and a reflectable flag. When an active melee hitbox overlaps a reflectable enemy projectile, flip its team, swap its material or palette, set its direction toward the original shooter if inside an aim-assist cone (else along the swing direction), multiply speed, extend the trail, reset its lifetime and apply a short hitstop to the batter. Ignore further overlaps with the player who reflected it.",
['FB-26','ACT-19','VFX-08','FB-33','NAV-16','ACT-21'],['cb_w_jfo','a2_w_ghostrunner','a2_w_mgr'])

E('FB-33','物件反應','Telekinetic grab & throw',["Telekinesis","Telekinetic throw","Gravity gun","Kinesis grab","Psychokinetic launch","Catch and release","Catch and throw back","念力抓物投擲","重力槍","接住擲回","念動力投げ","キャッチ＆リリース"],'C',
("念力抓物投擲（含接住擲回）",
 "玩家把準星對準場景中的物件（箱、碎石、油桶）並按住技能鍵：物件掙脫地面，沿短弧線飛到玩家身前上方，懸浮在那裡輕微旋轉和抖動，周圍有一圈細碎的粒子，手與物件之間有一道牽引線。準星改成投擲準星。放開時物件沿準星方向高速直線飛出並帶拖尾，撞到敵人或牆時碎開並把目標擊退。變化——接住擲回：敵人擲來的手榴彈或火箭在飛行中被同一技能抓住，停在玩家身前並轉成玩家方的顏色，再按一下便擲回給敵人。",
 "不是拍返飛行道具（FB-32，一次揮擊直接打回，不會停在手前）。不是武器召回（FB-30，固定的武器飛回手中）。不是拾取物吸附（FB-14，拾取物自動飛向玩家後消失）。念力的重點是「抓住 → 懸浮待命 → 由玩家瞄準擲出」三個階段。",
 "超能力、重力槍、磁力手套類能力；把場景雜物變成彈藥；化解敵人的手榴彈威脅。",
 "為遊戲加入念力抓物投擲。按住技能鍵時，選取準星附近 10–15 米內最合適的可抓物件：物件在 0.2–0.35 秒內沿弧線飛到玩家身前上方約 1–1.5 米處，懸浮時持續輕微旋轉與上下浮動，加一圈細粒子和連到手部的牽引線。放開時沿準星方向高速飛出並帶拖尾，命中時碎開並擊退目標。變化：敵方擲來的物件在飛行中也可被抓住，懸浮期間改為玩家方顏色，再按投擲即擲回。驗收：抓取、懸浮、擲出三個階段在畫面上清楚可分；從地上抓物與在空中接住敵方手榴彈都能正確懸浮並擲出。"),
("Telekinetic grab & throw",
 "The player aims at a prop in the scene (crate, rubble, barrel) and holds the ability button: the prop tears free, flies along a short arc to a point in front of and above the player, and hovers there with a slight spin and wobble, a ring of fine particles around it and a tether line to the hand. The reticle switches to a throw reticle. On release the prop shoots out straight along the aim with a trail, shattering on impact with an enemy or wall and knocking the target back. Variant — catch and release: a grenade or rocket thrown by an enemy is grabbed in flight by the same ability, held in front of the player while switching to the player's colour, and thrown back with another press.",
 "Not projectile batting (FB-32, sent straight back within one swing, never held). Not weapon recall (FB-30, a fixed weapon flying back to the hand). Not pickup magnetism (FB-14, loot flies to the player and disappears). Telekinesis is the three-step grab → hold ready → aimed throw.",
 "Psychic powers, gravity guns, magnetic gloves; turning clutter into ammunition; defusing enemy grenade pressure.",
 "Add telekinetic grab and throw. While the ability button is held, pick the best grabbable prop within 10–15 m near the reticle: it flies along an arc over 0.2–0.35 s to a hold point about 1–1.5 m in front of and above the player, keeps a slight spin and bob while held, with a particle ring and a tether line to the hand. On release it launches fast along the aim with a trail and shatters on impact, knocking the target back. Variant: objects thrown by enemies can also be grabbed in flight; while held they switch to the player's colour and are thrown back on the throw input. Accept: grab, hold and throw read as three distinct stages, and both a floor prop and an enemy grenade caught mid-air hover and throw correctly."),
("念動力の掴み投げ（キャッチ＆リリース含む）",
 "照準を場面の物（箱・瓦礫・ドラム缶）に合わせて能力ボタンを押し続けると、物が地面から引き剥がされ、短い弧を描いてプレイヤーの前上方へ飛び、そこで少し回転しながら揺れて浮かぶ。周りには細かな粒子の輪があり、手と物の間に牽引線が伸びる。照準は投擲用に変わる。離すと物は照準方向へ尾を引いて高速でまっすぐ飛び、敵や壁に当たると砕けて相手を吹き飛ばす。変化——キャッチ＆リリース：敵が投げた手榴弾やロケットを飛行中に同じ能力で掴み、手前で止めてプレイヤー側の色に変え、もう一度押して投げ返す。",
 "弾き返し（FB-32、一振りで直接打ち返し、手前で止めない）ではない。武器の呼び戻し（FB-30、決まった武器が手に戻る）でも、アイテム吸引（FB-14、拾った物が飛んできて消える）でもない。念動力は「掴む → 浮かせて待つ → 狙って投げる」の 3 段階。",
 "超能力、重力銃、磁力グローブ型の能力。散らかった物を弾薬にする。敵の手榴弾の脅威を無力化する。",
 "念動力の掴み投げを追加する。能力ボタンを押している間、照準付近 10〜15 m 以内で最適な掴める物を選び、0.2〜0.35 秒で弧を描いてプレイヤーの前上方約 1〜1.5 m の保持点へ運ぶ。保持中は少し回転と上下の揺れを続け、粒子の輪と手への牽引線を付ける。離すと照準方向へ尾を引いて高速で飛ばし、命中で砕けて相手を吹き飛ばす。変化：敵が投げた物も飛行中に掴めるようにし、保持中はプレイヤー側の色にし、投げ入力で投げ返す。検証：掴む・浮かせる・投げるの 3 段階が画面上ではっきり分かれ、床の物も空中で捕えた敵の手榴弾も正しく浮いて投げられること。"),
'grab range 10–15 m & reticle cone · pull time 0.2–0.35 s & arc height · hold point offset (front / above) · hover spin & bob · tether & particle ring · launch speed & trail · catch window for incoming throws · team colour swap on catch (authoring defaults)',
"Pick the best grabbable within a cone and range around the reticle. Switch it to kinematic and move it along a short arc to a hold socket in front of the camera; while held, spring it toward the socket with a little noise for wobble and spin. On release restore physics, set its velocity along the aim ray (or toward an aim-assisted target), enable a trail and resolve impact with a knockback impulse. For catch and release, let incoming thrown projectiles be grabbable in flight: suspend their fuse damage to the player, switch team and colour, and hold them like any other prop.",
['FB-32','FB-30','FB-14','VFX-08','ACT-29','FB-31'],['a2_w_control','a2_w_hl2','cb_w_deadspace'])

E('NAV-15','放置與範圍','Blink targeting arc / Ledge-snapped landing preview',["Blink targeting","Teleport arc","Teleport preview","Landing marker","Ledge snap preview","Blink marker","瞬移落點預覽","瞬移弧線","テレポート照準","着地点プレビュー"],'C',
("瞬移落點弧線預覽",
 "按住瞬移鍵時，角色手部射出一道弧線，末端有一個落點標記（角色剪影或圓環）。指向牆邊或平台邊緣時，標記會自動吸附到邊緣上方可以站立的位置，並出現一個向上的小箭頭，表示會攀上邊緣；指向超出距離或無法落腳的地方時，弧線變紅，標記變成交叉。放開按鍵時角色瞬間移到標記位置，起點留下一陣殘影粒子，落點有一圈小衝擊波。",
 "不是放置預覽（NAV-05，預覽要建造的物件位置）。不是範圍指示（NAV-06，顯示攻擊範圍圈）。不是傳送出現特效（VFX-15，只負責出現或消失那一下的特效）。本條是發動前「會落在哪裡」的預覽，以及對邊緣的吸附。",
 "短距離瞬移、抓鉤落點、VR 瞬移移動、跳上高處的移動技能。",
 "為瞬移技能加入落點預覽。按住技能鍵時從角色手部畫出一條弧線，最遠 15–20 米，末端顯示落點標記。若末端碰到牆面，而上方 0.5–1 米內有可站立的邊緣頂面，就把標記吸附到該頂面，並加一個向上的小箭頭。超出範圍或無法站立時，弧線改為紅色、標記改為交叉，放開也不會移動。放開時在 0.1 秒內把角色移到標記處，起點留下殘影粒子，落點播放小衝擊波。驗收：指向邊緣下方的牆面時，落點正確吸附到邊緣上方，角色不會卡進牆內。"),
("Blink targeting arc / Ledge-snapped landing preview",
 "While the blink button is held, an arc shoots from the character's hand and ends in a landing marker (a character silhouette or ring). Aimed at a wall below a ledge or a platform edge, the marker snaps to the standable spot on top of the edge and shows a small up arrow meaning the character will climb onto it; aimed beyond range or somewhere you cannot stand, the arc turns red and the marker becomes a cross. On release the character jumps instantly to the marker, leaving a puff of afterimage particles at the start and a small shock ring at the landing.",
 "Not a placement ghost (NAV-05, previewing where a building will go). Not a range indicator (NAV-06, an attack radius). Not a spawn or teleport effect (VFX-15, only the flash of appearing or vanishing). This card is the before-the-move preview of where you will land, including the ledge snap.",
 "Short-range teleport, grapple landing points, VR teleport locomotion, movement powers that reach high places.",
 "Add a landing preview to the blink ability. While the button is held, draw an arc from the character's hand out to 15–20 m with a landing marker at its end. If the end hits a wall and a standable ledge top lies within 0.5–1 m above, snap the marker onto that top and add a small up arrow. Out of range or with no room to stand, turn the arc red and the marker into a cross, and do not move on release. On release move the character to the marker within 0.1 s, leave afterimage particles at the start and play a small shock ring at the landing. Accept: aiming at the wall just under a ledge snaps the landing onto the ledge top, and the character never ends up inside the wall."),
("瞬間移動の着地点プレビュー（弧線と縁への吸着）",
 "ブリンクボタンを押している間、キャラの手から弧線が伸び、先端に着地点マーカー（キャラのシルエットや輪）が出る。縁の下の壁や足場の端を狙うと、マーカーは縁の上の立てる位置へ吸い付き、よじ登ることを示す小さな上向き矢印が出る。射程外や立てない場所を狙うと弧線が赤くなり、マーカーは×になる。離すとキャラはマーカーの位置へ一瞬で移動し、出発点には残像の粒子、着地点には小さな衝撃の輪が出る。",
 "配置ゴースト（NAV-05、建てる物の位置のプレビュー）ではない。射程表示（NAV-06、攻撃範囲の円）でも、出現・テレポート演出（VFX-15、現れる・消える瞬間の演出だけ）でもない。本項目は発動前の「どこに着くか」のプレビューと縁への吸着。",
 "短距離テレポート、フックショットの着地点、VR のテレポート移動、高所へ届く移動スキル。",
 "ブリンク能力に着地点プレビューを追加する。ボタンを押している間、手から最大 15〜20 m の弧線を描き、先端に着地点マーカーを出す。先端が壁に当たり、その上 0.5〜1 m 以内に立てる縁の上面があれば、マーカーをそこへ吸着させ小さな上向き矢印を付ける。射程外や立つ余地がない場合は弧線を赤、マーカーを×にし、離しても移動しない。離したら 0.1 秒以内にマーカーへ移動し、出発点に残像の粒子、着地点に小さな衝撃の輪。検証：縁のすぐ下の壁を狙うと着地点が縁の上に吸着し、キャラが壁に埋まらないこと。"),
'max range 15–20 m · arc vs straight ray · ledge search height 0.5–1 m & inward depth · standing-clearance test · valid / invalid colours · marker shape (silhouette / ring / cross) · mantle arrow · travel time ≤ 0.1 s (authoring defaults)',
"Each frame while aiming, trace the arc (or ray) from the hand and take the first hit. If it hits a wall, search upward and inward a short distance for a ledge top with enough standing clearance (capsule test) and, if found, place the marker there and flag a mantle. If it hits a floor, test clearance in place. Colour the arc and marker from the validity result. On release, teleport (or very fast lerp) the character to the marker and spawn departure and arrival effects.",
['NAV-05','NAV-06','VFX-15','ANI-22','NAV-02','FX-03'],['a2_w_dishonored','a2_w_dishonored2'])

E('ACT-46','戰鬥時間、命中反應與防護','Bob and weave / Slip',["Bob and weave","Slip","Sway dodge","Duck","Lean-back dodge","Upper-body evade","原地搖身閃避","搖頭閃避","下潛閃避","スウェー","ダッキング"],'C',
("原地搖身閃避（Slip／Bob and weave）",
 "敵人出拳或揮擊時，玩家按閃避方向，角色雙腳留在原地，只把上身和頭部側擺、後仰或下蹲，讓攻擊在頭側或頭頂擦過。攻擊者揮空，身體多向前衝一點；角色隨即回正，比後撤或翻滾更快恢復，而且仍在攻擊距離內，可以立刻反擊。直拳多用側擺或後仰，高位橫掃多用下蹲。",
 "不是完美閃避窗口（ACT-43，判定時機與無敵幀的規則，也常帶慢動作）。不是完美格擋（FB-26，有接觸，雙方停頓）。不是翻滾或衝刺閃避（整個身體移位，閃完已離開攻擊距離）。本條是腳不移動、只靠上身避開，閃完仍然站在原位。",
 "拳擊、徒手近身格鬥、以讀招與反擊為核心的戰鬥。",
 "為近身戰加入原地搖身閃避。玩家在敵人攻擊判定到達前按閃避方向：雙腳固定不動，上身在 0.15–0.25 秒內依方向側擺、後仰或下蹲，頭部移開約 0.3–0.5 米；只有頭部與上身的受擊判定跟著骨骼移開，而不是整個角色無敵。攻擊揮空時讓攻擊者多前衝一步。閃避後 0.1–0.2 秒內回正，回正期間可直接接反擊。驗收：直拳、高位橫掃各閃一次都正確避開，閃完角色仍在原位、仍在反擊距離內。"),
("Bob and weave / Slip",
 "As an enemy punches or swings, the player presses a dodge direction and the character keeps both feet planted, moving only the upper body and head — slipping to the side, leaning back or ducking — so the attack grazes past the side of the head or overhead. The attacker whiffs and over-extends a little forward; the character snaps back upright faster than a back-step or roll and is still in range to counter at once. Straight punches are usually slipped or leaned away from; high sweeps are ducked.",
 "Not a perfect dodge window (ACT-43, the timing and i-frame rule, often with slow motion). Not a perfect parry (FB-26, contact with a mutual pause). Not a roll or dash dodge (the whole body relocates and ends out of range). This card is feet-planted upper-body evasion that leaves you exactly where you were.",
 "Boxing, unarmed close combat, fighting built around reading attacks and countering.",
 "Add a feet-planted slip to close combat. When the player presses a dodge direction before the enemy hit lands, lock the feet and move the upper body over 0.15–0.25 s by direction — side slip, lean back or duck — taking the head 0.3–0.5 m off the line; move only the head and torso hurtboxes with the bones rather than making the whole character invulnerable. On a whiff, push the attacker one step forward into an over-extended recovery. Return upright over 0.1–0.2 s and allow a direct counter during the return. Accept: a straight punch and a high sweep are each avoided, and afterwards the character is still on the same spot and in counter range."),
("その場のスウェー回避（スリップ／ボブ＆ウィーブ）",
 "敵のパンチや振りに合わせて回避方向を押すと、キャラは両足をその場に残したまま上体と頭だけを横へ振る・後ろへ反らす・沈める。攻撃は頭の横や上をかすめて空を切る。攻撃側は空振りして少し前へつんのめり、キャラはバックステップや転がりより早く体勢を戻し、まだ間合いの中にいるのですぐ反撃できる。ストレートには横へのスリップやスウェー、高い薙ぎ払いにはダッキングが多い。",
 "ジャスト回避の窓（ACT-43、タイミングと無敵フレームのルールで、スローを伴うことも多い）ではない。ジャストガード（FB-26、接触して双方が止まる）でもない。転がりやダッシュ回避（体ごと移動して間合いの外へ出る）でもない。本項目は足を動かさず上体だけでかわし、終わっても同じ場所にいる回避。",
 "ボクシング、素手の近接格闘、読みと反撃が中心の戦闘。",
 "近接戦にその場のスウェー回避を追加する。敵の攻撃判定が届く前に回避方向を押したら、足を固定し、0.15〜0.25 秒で方向に応じて上体を横へ・後ろへ・下へ動かし、頭を 0.3〜0.5 m ずらす。キャラ全体を無敵にするのではなく、頭と上体のやられ判定だけを骨に合わせて動かす。空振りした攻撃側は一歩前へつんのめる硬直にする。0.1〜0.2 秒で体勢を戻し、戻る途中から直接反撃できるようにする。検証：ストレートと高い薙ぎ払いをそれぞれ避け、避けた後も同じ位置で反撃の間合いにいること。"),
'slip directions (side / lean back / duck) · head travel 0.3–0.5 m · slip time 0.15–0.25 s · return 0.1–0.2 s · moved hurtboxes (head / torso) vs i-frames · attacker over-commit step · counter window on return (authoring defaults)',
"Play an upper-body layered or additive slip animation keyed to the input direction while the root and feet stay locked. Attach head and torso hurtboxes to the animated bones so the attack misses by geometry rather than by blanket invulnerability. If the attack whiffs, send the attacker into an over-extended recovery. Open a short counter-cancel window on the return frames.",
['ACT-43','FB-26','ACT-27','ACT-42','ACT-34','ACT-25'],['a2_w_sifu','a2_w_punchout','a2_w_godhand'])

E('UI-28','HUD 與介面類型','Directional guard indicator',["Directional guard","Directional block","Stance direction indicator","Guard direction reticle","Directional combat UI","方向架勢格擋","方向防禦指示","三向架勢","方向ガード","構え方向インジケーター"],'C',
("方向架勢格擋指示",
 "鎖定對手時，對手身邊出現一個分成三格（左、上、右）的架勢標記。玩家用搖桿選擇架勢方向時，標記中對應的一格亮起青色，角色的武器也舉向那一邊。對手準備從某方向出招時，同一標記上那一格變紅並閃爍。玩家把架勢移到相同方向便能擋下：接觸點出現火花，紅格熄滅；方向不同就被擊中。",
 "不是威脅方向環（UI-27，提示畫面外敵人從哪個方位出招，與格擋方向無關）。不是攻擊預警（NAV-04，標出地上的受擊範圍）。也不是完美格擋（FB-26，看的是時機而不是方向）。本條是「攻與守都要選方向」的配對提示。",
 "刀劍決鬥、一對一近身戰、需要讀對手出招方向的戰鬥系統。",
 "為一對一近戰加入方向架勢指示。鎖定時在對手身邊顯示三格標記（左、上、右）：玩家選擇的方向那一格亮青色，武器姿勢同步指向那邊。對手攻擊開始時，標記上對應的一格變紅並閃爍，直到攻擊結算。結算時若玩家架勢與攻擊方向相同，判為擋下，在接觸點播放火花並熄滅紅格；不同則判為命中。驗收：三個方向的攻擊各試一次，同方向擋下、不同方向被擊中，標記與武器姿勢始終一致。"),
("Directional guard indicator",
 "While locked on, a three-segment stance marker (left, top, right) sits around the opponent. As the player picks a guard direction with the stick, the matching segment lights cyan and the character's weapon swings to that side. When the opponent winds up an attack from a direction, that segment of the same marker turns red and flashes. Moving the guard to the same direction blocks it — sparks at the contact and the red segment goes out; a different direction gets hit.",
 "Not a threat direction ring (UI-27, which tells you from which bearing an off-screen enemy attacks, nothing to do with guard direction). Not an attack telegraph (NAV-04, the area about to be hit on the ground). Not a perfect parry (FB-26, which is about timing, not direction). This card is the match-the-direction cue where both attack and defence choose a side.",
 "Sword duels, one-on-one melee, combat systems where you read the direction of the opponent's attack.",
 "Add a directional guard indicator to one-on-one melee. While locked on, draw a three-segment marker (left, top, right) around the opponent: the player's chosen direction lights cyan and the weapon pose follows it. When the opponent starts an attack, flash the matching segment red until the attack resolves. On resolve, if the player's guard matches the attack direction it is a block — sparks at the contact and the red segment goes out — otherwise a hit. Accept: one attack from each of the three directions; matching blocks, mismatching hits, and the marker always agrees with the weapon pose."),
("方向ガードのインジケーター",
 "ロックオン中、相手の周りに 3 分割（左・上・右）の構えマーカーが出る。プレイヤーがスティックで構えの方向を選ぶと、対応する区画がシアンに光り、キャラの武器もその側へ構えられる。相手がある方向から攻撃を始めると、同じマーカーのその区画が赤く点滅する。構えを同じ方向へ合わせれば防げて、接点に火花が出て赤い区画が消える。方向が違えば被弾する。",
 "脅威方向リング（UI-27、画面外の敵がどの方角から攻撃するかを示すもので、ガード方向とは無関係）ではない。攻撃予告（NAV-04、地面の被弾範囲）でもない。ジャストガード（FB-26、方向ではなくタイミング）でもない。本項目は攻めも守りも方向を選ぶ「方向合わせ」の合図。",
 "剣の決闘、一対一の近接戦、相手の攻撃方向を読む戦闘システム。",
 "一対一の近接戦に方向ガードのインジケーターを追加する。ロックオン中は相手の周りに 3 分割（左・上・右）のマーカーを描き、プレイヤーが選んだ方向をシアンに光らせ、武器の構えも合わせる。相手が攻撃を始めたら、該当する区画を攻撃が決着するまで赤く点滅させる。決着時に構えと攻撃方向が一致すればガード成功として接点に火花を出し赤い区画を消し、一致しなければ被弾。検証：3 方向から 1 回ずつ攻撃し、一致すれば防ぎ、違えば当たり、マーカーと武器の構えが常に一致すること。"),
'direction count (3–5) · marker anchor (around opponent / screen centre) · own-guard colour · incoming colour & flash rate · flash lead time before impact · block spark · shown only while locked on (authoring defaults)',
"Store a guard direction per fighter, set from the stick while locked on. Draw a segmented marker anchored to the opponent in screen space; highlight the player's own segment and drive the upper-body guard pose from the same value. When an attack starts, tag it with a direction and flash that segment from wind-up until resolution. On impact compare directions: equal → block feedback; otherwise hit.",
['UI-27','NAV-04','FB-26','ACT-23','ACT-42','ACT-44'],['a2_w_forhonor','a2_w_mountblade'])

E('ANI-23','動畫系統技術','Creature climbing / Clinging to large enemies',["Creature climbing","Colossus climbing","Monster mounting","Clinging","Grab and climb","Shake-off","攀爬大型生物","攀附巨獸","甩落","巨大生物登攀","しがみつき"],'C',
("攀爬大型生物（攀附與甩落）",
 "角色跳上或抓住巨大敵人的身體（毛髮、鱗片、裝甲邊緣），雙手雙腳貼著對方表面，隨對方的身體一起移動：巨大敵人走動時角色跟著上下起伏。對方猛力甩動時，角色身體被甩得向外擺，雙腳離開表面，只剩雙手抓緊，鏡頭同步搖晃；甩動停止後角色重新貼回表面繼續爬。握力用完或被甩得太猛時，角色被拋離，沿弧線飛出再落地。",
 "不是黃漆攀爬標記（NAV-02，標出靜止場景中可攀的位置）。不是自動翻越（ANI-22，越過靜止障礙）。不是手部接觸 IK（ANI-21，手按在靜止物件上）。本條的攀爬面本身在動，角色的姿勢與擺動都要跟隨對方身體。",
 "巨型 Boss、爬上去攻擊弱點、攀附或騎乘大型生物的戰鬥。",
 "為大型敵人加入可攀爬表面。角色抓住標記為可攀的部位時，把角色掛到最近的骨骼上，雙手與雙腳用 IK 貼在表面，敵人移動時角色隨之移動。敵人做甩動動作時，依該骨骼的加速度把角色身體向外擺 20–45°，雙腳離開表面只剩雙手抓住，鏡頭同步搖晃；甩動結束後 0.3–0.5 秒內貼回表面。握力耗盡或甩動超過上限時，沿甩動方向把角色拋出，並播放落地動作。驗收：敵人走動、甩動、角色被甩脫三種情況表現正確，角色不會穿進敵人身體。"),
("Creature climbing / Clinging to large enemies",
 "The character leaps onto or grabs a giant enemy's body (fur, scales, armour edges), hands and feet pressed to its surface, and rides along with it: when the giant walks, the character bobs up and down with it. When it shakes violently, the character's body swings outward, the feet come off and only the hands hold on, with the camera shaking in sync; once the shaking stops the character presses back to the surface and keeps climbing. If grip runs out or the shake is too strong, the character is flung off along an arc and lands.",
 "Not yellow paint climb markers (NAV-02, which mark climbable spots on static scenery). Not a contextual vault (ANI-22, over a static obstacle). Not hand contact IK (ANI-21, a hand on a static object). Here the climbing surface itself moves, and the character's pose and swing follow the creature's body.",
 "Giant bosses, climbing up to strike a weak point, clinging to or riding large creatures in combat.",
 "Add climbable surfaces to large enemies. When the character grabs a region tagged climbable, attach it to the nearest bone and keep hands and feet on the surface with IK so it moves with the enemy. When the enemy plays a shake, swing the character's body outward 20–45° from that bone's acceleration, lift the feet so only the hands hold on, and shake the camera in sync; re-plant within 0.3–0.5 s after the shake. When grip runs out or the shake exceeds a limit, fling the character off along the shake direction and play a landing. Accept: enemy walking, shaking and shaking the character off all look right, and the character never clips into the enemy's body."),
("巨大生物への登攀（しがみつきと振り落とし）",
 "キャラが巨大な敵の体（毛・鱗・装甲の縁）に飛び付き、両手両足を相手の表面に付けたまま一緒に動く。巨大な敵が歩けば、キャラもそれに合わせて上下に揺れる。相手が激しく体を振ると、キャラの体は外側へ振られ、足が離れて両手だけでしがみつき、カメラも同時に揺れる。揺れが収まると表面に戻って登り続ける。握力が尽きるか揺れが強すぎると、キャラは弧を描いて振り落とされ着地する。",
 "黄色いペンキの登攀目印（NAV-02、静止した場所の登れる位置を示す）ではない。自動乗り越え（ANI-22、静止した障害物を越える）でも、手の接触 IK（ANI-21、静止物に手を置く）でもない。本項目は登る面そのものが動き、キャラの姿勢と揺れが相手の体に追従する。",
 "巨大ボス、弱点まで登って攻撃する戦い、大型生物にしがみつく・乗る戦闘。",
 "大型の敵に登れる面を追加する。登攀可能タグの部位を掴んだら、キャラを最寄りの骨に付け、両手両足を IK で表面に合わせ、敵の動きに追従させる。敵が体を振るモーションでは、その骨の加速度から体を外へ 20〜45° 振り、足を離して両手だけで掴ませ、カメラも揺らす。揺れが終わったら 0.3〜0.5 秒で表面に戻す。握力が尽きるか揺れが上限を超えたら、振りの方向へ放り出して着地させる。検証：敵が歩く・体を振る・振り落とすの 3 つが正しく見え、キャラが敵の体にめり込まないこと。"),
'climbable regions (tagged bones) · attach to nearest bone · hand & foot IK · sway 20–45° from bone acceleration · feet-off threshold · re-plant 0.3–0.5 s · camera shake on shake-off · fling arc · grip meter link to UX-02 (authoring defaults)',
"Tag climbable regions on the creature's skeleton. On grab, parent the character to the nearest bone with a local offset and move it across the surface in bone space from input. Each frame solve hand and foot IK onto the surface. Read the bone's linear and angular acceleration and feed it into a damped spring that swings the body around the hand grip, lifting the feet above a threshold; drive camera shake from the same value. When the grip meter empties or acceleration exceeds a limit, detach and launch along the current velocity.",
['NAV-02','ANI-22','ANI-21','UX-02','NAV-09','ACT-36'],['a2_w_sotc','a2_w_dragonsdogma'])

E('CAM-37','回饋與轉場','Perspective shift (3D ↔ side-scroll / top-down)',["Perspective shift","Dimension shift","2.5D section","Side-scrolling section","Top-down section","Camera mode switch with input remap","視角維度轉換","3D 轉橫向捲軸","2D 段落","視点切り替え","2D 区間"],'C',
("視角維度轉換（3D ↔ 橫向／俯視）",
 "角色在第三人稱視角中走進某個區域，鏡頭在約一秒內平順地轉到正側面（或正上方）並拉遠，畫面變成橫向捲軸（或俯視）。此後左右輸入直接對應畫面左右，角色被限制在一條軌道平面上，不能再往深度方向走；離開區域時鏡頭轉回角色身後，輸入回到以鏡頭為準的 3D 移動。轉換期間角色的前進方向保持連貫，不會因為鏡頭轉動而突然改變。",
 "不是一般的鏡頭混合（CAM-32，只是兩個鏡頭之間的過渡，玩法維度不變）。不是正交投影（CAM-17，只是投影方式）。本條是鏡頭、輸入軸與移動限制一起改變的玩法維度切換。",
 "動作遊戲中的橫向捲軸段落、俯視射擊段落、致敬 2D 時代的區域、需要換角度觀看的解謎。",
 "為遊戲加入視角維度轉換。玩家進入轉換區時，鏡頭在 0.8–1.2 秒內由角色身後平順轉到正側面，距離拉遠並把 FOV 收窄（或改為正交）。轉換完成後，左右輸入直接對應畫面左右，角色被鎖在區域的軌道平面上，深度方向的移動被移除。轉換期間沿用玩家進入時的移動方向，直到玩家放開搖桿才改用新的輸入對應。離開區域時用相同方式轉回第三人稱。驗收：按住同一方向穿過轉換區，角色不會突然轉向或走回頭。"),
("Perspective shift (3D ↔ side-scroll / top-down)",
 "The character walks into a zone in third-person view and, over about a second, the camera swings smoothly round to a pure side view (or straight overhead) and pulls back, turning the screen into a side-scroller (or top-down). From then on left/right input maps straight to screen left/right and the character is held on a rail plane with no movement in depth; leaving the zone swings the camera back behind the character and input returns to camera-relative 3D movement. The character's heading stays continuous through the swing instead of jerking with the camera.",
 "Not an ordinary camera blend (CAM-32, a transition between two cameras where the gameplay dimension stays the same). Not orthographic projection (CAM-17, just the projection). This card switches the gameplay dimension: camera, input axes and movement constraint change together.",
 "Side-scrolling sections inside 3D action games, top-down shooting sections, areas that pay homage to 2D eras, puzzles that need another viewing angle.",
 "Add a perspective shift. When the player enters a shift zone, swing the camera from behind the character to a pure side view over 0.8–1.2 s, pulling back and narrowing the FOV (or switching to orthographic). Once done, map left/right input directly to screen left/right, lock the character onto the zone's rail plane and remove movement in depth. Keep the movement direction held at entry until the stick is released, then switch to the new mapping. Swing back to third person the same way on exit. Accept: holding one direction through the zone never makes the character turn suddenly or walk back."),
("視点の次元切り替え（3D ↔ 横スクロール／見下ろし）",
 "三人称視点でキャラがある区域に入ると、カメラが約 1 秒で真横（または真上）へ滑らかに回り込んで引き、画面が横スクロール（または見下ろし）になる。以後は左右入力がそのまま画面の左右に対応し、キャラはレール平面に固定され奥行き方向へは動けない。区域を出るとカメラは背後へ戻り、入力もカメラ基準の 3D 移動に戻る。切り替えの間もキャラの進行方向は途切れず、カメラの回転で急に変わらない。",
 "通常のカメラブレンド（CAM-32、2 つのカメラ間の遷移で、遊びの次元は変わらない）ではない。正投影（CAM-17、投影方法だけ）でもない。本項目はカメラ・入力軸・移動制限がまとめて変わる、遊びの次元の切り替え。",
 "3D アクション内の横スクロール区間、見下ろし型の射撃区間、2D 時代へのオマージュ区域、視点を変えて解く謎解き。",
 "視点の次元切り替えを追加する。切り替え区域に入ったら、0.8〜1.2 秒でカメラをキャラの背後から真横へ滑らかに回し、引きながら FOV を狭める（または正投影にする）。完了後は左右入力を画面の左右に直結し、キャラを区域のレール平面に固定して奥行き方向の移動をなくす。切り替え中は進入時の移動方向を維持し、スティックを離してから新しい対応に切り替える。出るときも同じ方法で三人称へ戻す。検証：同じ方向を押したまま区域を通過しても、キャラが急に向きを変えたり逆走したりしないこと。"),
'transition 0.8–1.2 s & easing · target view (side / top-down) · distance & FOV (or ortho) · input remap (camera-relative ↔ screen axis) · rail-plane constraint & soft snap · held-input direction lock · enter / exit volumes (authoring defaults)',
"Trigger volumes switch camera mode. Blend position, rotation and FOV (or projection) from the follow camera to a fixed side or top camera over the transition. Swap the input mapping from camera-relative 3D movement to screen-axis movement projected onto the rail plane, and constrain the character to that plane with a gentle snap. Cache the movement direction at entry and keep using it until the stick is released or reversed, so the camera rotation does not twist the player's path.",
['CAM-32','CAM-17','CAM-10','CAM-07','CAM-01'],['a2_w_nier','a2_w_odyssey'])

E('NAV-16','可讀性','Colour-coded projectiles / Readable barrage',["Colour-coded projectiles","Bullet colour coding","Readable bullet hell","Projectile response colours","Destructible vs indestructible bullets","顏色分類彈幕","彈幕顏色規則","可打碎子彈","弾の色分け","破壊可能弾"],'D',
("顏色分類彈幕（顏色代表應對方式）",
 "密集彈幕中，每種子彈的顏色和外形代表玩家應該怎樣應對：例如橙色圓彈可以被射擊打碎，紫色尖角彈打不碎、只能閃開，地面擴散的藍色環可以用衝刺穿過。同一種顏色在整個遊戲中永遠代表同一種應對方式。子彈比背景亮，並有深色描邊，所以在爆炸與特效之中仍然看得見；轉成灰階時，仍可靠外形分辨。",
 "不是一般的明暗與飽和度層級（FX-12，整體畫面的視覺重點分配）；本條把具體的顏色固定成應對規則。也不是攻擊預警（NAV-04，提前標示受擊範圍）或不可防禦警示（FB-28，單一招式的警示符號）。",
 "彈幕射擊、Boss 彈幕、子彈地獄與動作混合的遊戲。",
 "為彈幕建立顏色規則。每種應對方式只用一種顏色加一種外形：可擊碎的子彈用橙色圓形，不可擊碎的用紫色尖角形，可衝刺穿過的地面波用藍色環。所有子彈要比背景明顯更亮，並加 1–2 像素深色描邊；爆炸、粒子等其他特效不得使用這幾種保留色。同一顏色在整個遊戲中只代表一種應對方式，並提供色弱模式，以外形區分。驗收：把畫面轉成灰階時，仍能靠外形分辨三類子彈。"),
("Colour-coded projectiles / Readable barrage",
 "In a dense barrage each bullet's colour and shape tell the player how to respond: for example, orange round shots can be shot down, purple spiked shots cannot and must be avoided, and a blue ring spreading along the ground can be dashed through. One colour always means the same response across the whole game. Bullets are brighter than the background and carry a dark outline, so they stay visible among explosions and effects; in grayscale they can still be told apart by shape.",
 "Not general value and saturation hierarchy (FX-12, how visual emphasis is distributed over the whole image); this card locks specific colours to response rules. Not an attack telegraph (NAV-04, marking the hit area in advance) or an unblockable signifier (FB-28, a warning symbol for one attack).",
 "Shoot-'em-ups, boss barrages, bullet-hell and action hybrids.",
 "Build a colour rule for the barrage. Use exactly one colour plus one shape per response: orange circles for destructible shots, purple spiked shapes for indestructible ones, blue rings for ground waves you can dash through. Make every bullet clearly brighter than the background with a 1–2 px dark outline, and keep the reserved colours out of explosions, particles and other effects. A colour means only one response for the whole game; provide a colour-blind mode that relies on shape. Accept: with the screen converted to grayscale, the three bullet types can still be told apart by shape."),
("弾の色分け（色が対処法を表す弾幕）",
 "密度の高い弾幕で、弾の色と形がプレイヤーの対処法を表す。例えばオレンジの丸弾は撃って壊せ、紫のトゲ弾は壊せず避けるしかなく、地面を広がる青い輪はダッシュで抜けられる。同じ色はゲーム全体でいつも同じ対処法を意味する。弾は背景より明るく暗い縁取りがあるので、爆発やエフェクトの中でも見え、グレースケールにしても形で見分けられる。",
 "画面全体の明暗・彩度の階層（FX-12、視覚的な強調の配分）ではない。本項目は特定の色を対処ルールに固定する。攻撃予告（NAV-04、被弾範囲を事前に示す）やガード不能の合図（FB-28、一つの技の警告記号）でもない。",
 "シューティング、ボスの弾幕、弾幕とアクションの混合ゲーム。",
 "弾幕に色のルールを作る。対処法ごとに色 1 つと形 1 つだけを使う：壊せる弾はオレンジの丸、壊せない弾は紫のトゲ形、ダッシュで抜けられる地面の波は青い輪。すべての弾を背景よりはっきり明るくし、1〜2 px の暗い縁取りを付け、爆発や粒子など他のエフェクトには予約色を使わない。一つの色はゲーム全体で一つの対処法だけを表し、形で区別する色覚サポートモードも用意する。検証：画面をグレースケールにしても、3 種類の弾を形で見分けられること。"),
'response categories (destroy / avoid / dash through / jump) · one colour + one shape each · brightness margin over background · dark outline 1–2 px · reserved hues banned from other VFX · colour-blind shape fallback (authoring defaults)',
"Define a small projectile response table (category → colour, shape, outline) and drive every projectile's material from it instead of per-enemy art. Render projectiles in a late pass above most effects with an outline, and lint other effects so they never use the reserved hues. Provide an alternative palette and make shape carry the category so grayscale still separates them.",
['FX-12','NAV-04','FB-28','NAV-03','FB-32','A11Y-03'],['a2_w_ikaruga','a2_gp_nier_hack','a2_w_returnal'])

E('ACT-47','戰鬥時間、命中反應與防護','Air juggle / Launcher',["Air juggle","Juggle","Launcher","Air combo","Juggle decay","Spike","浮空連擊","挑空","空中追打","浮かせ","空中コンボ"],'C',
("浮空連擊（挑空與滯空）",
 "角色用上挑攻擊把敵人打上半空，自己可以跟著跳上去。敵人在空中每被打中一下，就停頓並略微向上彈，下落速度明顯比平常慢，好像被「掛」在空中，讓玩家連續追打。連段越長，每下彈起的高度越小、停留越短，敵人逐漸下沉；最後一下向下重擊，敵人急速砸落地面、反彈一次並揚起塵土。",
 "不是下劈反彈（ACT-45，被彈起的是攻擊者自己）。不是擊退（ACT-29，主要是水平推開）。也不是頂點滯空（ACT-03，玩家自己跳躍頂點的重力減弱）。本條控制的是被打敵人在空中停留的重力與彈起。",
 "華麗動作遊戲、格鬥遊戲的浮空連段、空中戰鬥。",
 "為近戰加入浮空連擊。上挑攻擊命中時把敵人向上打起約 2–3 米，玩家可按跳躍跟上。敵人在空中時重力降到平常的 30–50%；每次在空中被擊中，停頓 3–5 幀，並給一個小的向上速度。同一連段中，每多一下，向上速度與停留時間逐步遞減（例如每下約 10–15%），讓敵人逐漸下沉，最終必定落地。向下重擊把敵人高速打落地面，著地時反彈一次、揚起塵土並輕微震動鏡頭。驗收：連續空中攻擊時敵人停在空中但逐漸下沉，不會無限停留。"),
("Air juggle / Launcher",
 "The character knocks an enemy into the air with a rising launcher and can jump up after it. Each hit in the air pauses the enemy and pops it slightly upward, and it falls far slower than normal, as if hung in the air, so the player can keep chasing with hits. The longer the string, the smaller each pop and the shorter each hang, so the enemy gradually sinks; the final downward spike slams it into the ground, where it bounces once and kicks up dust.",
 "Not a pogo bounce (ACT-45, where the attacker is the one bounced). Not knockback (ACT-29, mainly a horizontal push). Not apex hang time (ACT-03, reduced gravity at the top of the player's own jump). This card controls the gravity and pops that keep a struck enemy in the air.",
 "Stylish action games, juggle combos in fighting games, aerial combat.",
 "Add air juggles to melee. A launcher hit knocks the enemy about 2–3 m up and the player can jump to follow. While airborne the enemy's gravity drops to 30–50% of normal; each air hit applies 3–5 frames of hitstop and a small upward pop. Within one string, each extra hit shrinks the pop and the hang (e.g. about 10–15% per hit) so the enemy gradually sinks and always lands eventually. A downward spike sends the enemy into the ground at high speed, where it bounces once with dust and a light camera shake. Accept: under continuous air attacks the enemy hangs but steadily sinks and never stays up forever."),
("空中コンボ（浮かせと滞空）",
 "キャラが打ち上げ攻撃で敵を空中へ浮かせ、自分も跳んで追える。空中で一発当たるたびに敵は一瞬止まって少し上へ跳ね、落下は普段よりずっと遅く、空中に「吊られた」ようになって追撃を続けられる。コンボが長くなるほど一発ごとの跳ね上がりは小さく、滞空は短くなり、敵は徐々に沈む。最後の叩き落としで敵は地面へ急落し、一度バウンドして土煙が上がる。",
 "下突きバウンド（ACT-45、跳ね返るのは攻撃した本人）ではない。ノックバック（ACT-29、主に水平に押す）でも、頂点での滞空（ACT-03、プレイヤー自身のジャンプ頂点の重力軽減）でもない。本項目は殴られた敵を空中に留める重力と跳ね上がりを扱う。",
 "スタイリッシュアクション、格闘ゲームの空中コンボ、空中戦。",
 "近接戦に空中コンボを追加する。打ち上げ攻撃が当たったら敵を約 2〜3 m 打ち上げ、プレイヤーはジャンプで追える。空中の敵の重力は通常の 30〜50% にし、空中で当たるたびに 3〜5 フレームのヒットストップと小さな上向きの跳ね上がりを与える。一連のコンボでは一発ごとに跳ね上がりと滞空を少しずつ減らし（例：一発ごとに約 10〜15%）、敵が徐々に沈んで必ず着地するようにする。叩き落としは敵を高速で地面へ落とし、着地で一度バウンドさせて土煙と軽いカメラの揺れを出す。検証：空中攻撃を続けても敵は滞空しながら徐々に沈み、永遠に浮き続けないこと。"),
'launch height 2–3 m · airborne gravity scale 0.3–0.5 · per-hit hitstop 3–5 f · per-hit pop · juggle decay per hit (pop & hang shrink ~10–15 %) · spike speed · ground bounce & dust · camera shake on slam (authoring defaults)',
"Put airborne-hit enemies into a juggle state with reduced gravity. Each air hit applies hitstop and sets vertical velocity to a pop value multiplied by a decay factor that shrinks with the number of hits since launch; let the gravity scale also rise with the count so every string eventually lands. A spike sets a large downward velocity; on ground contact apply one small bounce, spawn dust and a camera shake, then enter knockdown.",
['ACT-45','ACT-29','ACT-03','ACT-21','ACT-22','FB-18','ACT-19'],['a2_w_dmc1','cb_w_dmc5'])
